questions.analysis:
将偶极子视为由两点电荷组成，其大小为 $\pm q$，相距为 $2l$。电像法的公式为

$$
r' = \frac{R^2}{r} \qquad q' = -\frac{R}{r}q
\tag{1}
$$

将组成偶极子的正负电荷用下标的 $\pm$ 标记，并作代换 $\alpha = l\cos\theta/2R$，则可以得到

$$
\begin{aligned}
r_{\pm} &= 2R(1 \mp \alpha) \quad & r_{\pm}' &= \frac{R}{2}(1 \pm \alpha) \\
q_{\pm} &= \pm q \quad & q_{\pm}' &= \mp\left(\frac{1}{2} \pm \frac{\alpha}{2}\right)q = \mp\frac{q}{2} - \frac{\alpha q}{2}
\end{aligned}
\tag{2}
$$

$r_+/r_- = r_-'/r_+'$，原像和球心组成的三角形与镜像和球心组成的三角形相似，因此两个镜像电荷间距为 $l/2$

$$
l' = \frac{r_+}{r_-'}l = \frac{l}{4}
\tag{3}
$$

因此该电偶极子的电像由三部分组成：

$$
p' = |q_+'|\cdot(2l') \approx \frac{1}{4}p \qquad \text{处于镜像位置 } r' = \frac{R}{2} \text{ 的偶极子，指向右下}
\tag{4}
$$

$$
\Delta q_1' = q_+' + q_-' = \alpha q \qquad \text{同镜像偶极子重合的点电荷}
\tag{5}
$$

$$
\Delta q_2' = -\Delta q_1' = -\alpha q \qquad \text{位于球心的点电荷，维持电荷守恒}
\tag{6}
$$

$p'$ 产生的场，原点为镜像偶极子处，极轴向左。$\beta$ 为逆时针旋转的角度坐标，$r$ 为径向坐标

$$
\varphi = \frac{1}{4\pi\varepsilon_0}\frac{p'\cdot r}{r} = \frac{-pr\cos(\beta+\theta)}{16\pi\varepsilon_0}
\tag{7}
$$

$$
\boldsymbol{E} = -\frac{p}{16\pi\varepsilon_0 r^3}\left[2\cos(\beta+\theta)\hat{\boldsymbol{r}} + \sin(\beta+\theta)\hat{\boldsymbol{\beta}}\right]
\tag{8}
$$

其余两个镜像电荷的场，$r_O$ 为以球心为原点的坐标

$$
\varphi = \frac{\alpha q}{4\pi\varepsilon_0}\left(\frac{1}{r} - \frac{1}{r+R/2}\right)
\tag{10}
$$

$$
\boldsymbol{E}_1 = \frac{\alpha q}{4\pi\varepsilon_0}\frac{\hat{r}}{r^2} = \frac{p\cos\theta\hat{r}}{16\pi\varepsilon_0 R r^2}
\tag{11}
$$

$$
\boldsymbol{E}_2 = -\frac{\alpha q}{4\pi\varepsilon_0}\frac{\hat{r}_O}{r_O^2} = -\frac{p\cos\theta\hat{r}_O}{16\pi\varepsilon_0 R r_O^2}
\tag{12}
$$

1. 偶极子在电场中的能量是 $-p\cdot E$，由于场由镜像电荷产生，计算能量时有额外的 $1/2$

$$
\begin{aligned}
U &= -\frac{1}{2}p\cdot E = -\frac{1}{2}\left[-\frac{p^2\cos^2\theta}{16\pi\varepsilon_0}\left(-\frac{2}{r^3} + \frac{1}{Rr^2} - \frac{1}{Rr_O^2}\right) + \frac{p^2\sin^2\theta}{16\pi\varepsilon_0 r^3}\right] \\
&= \frac{p^2}{32\pi\varepsilon_0 R^3}\left(-\frac{43}{108}\cos^2\theta - \frac{8}{27}\sin^2\theta\right) = \frac{p^2(32 + 11\cos^2\theta)}{3456\pi\varepsilon_0 R^3}
\end{aligned}
\tag{13}
$$

2. 偶极子在电场中受力 $\boldsymbol{p}\cdot\nabla E$，这里电场的梯度是一个二阶张量，在直角坐标中便于计算。取 $x$ 轴向左，$y$ 轴向下。

$$
\left.\frac{\partial E_x}{\partial x}\right|_{x=3R/2,y=0} = \frac{\partial E_r}{\partial r} = \frac{91p\cos\theta}{1728\pi\varepsilon_0 R^4}
\tag{14}
$$

$$
\left.\frac{\partial E_x}{\partial y}\right|_{x=3R/2,y=0} = \frac{1}{r}\frac{\partial E_r}{\partial\beta} + \frac{1}{r_O}\frac{\partial E_{r_O}}{\partial\beta} - \frac{E_\beta}{r} = \frac{p\sin\theta}{27\pi\varepsilon_0 R^4}
\tag{15}
$$

$$
\left.\frac{\partial E_y}{\partial x}\right|_{x=3R/2,y=0} = \frac{\partial E_\beta}{\partial r} = \frac{p\sin\theta}{27\pi\varepsilon_0 R^4}
\tag{16}
$$

$$
\left.\frac{\partial E_y}{\partial y}\right|_{x=3R/2,y=0} = \frac{1}{r}\frac{\partial E_\beta}{\partial\beta} + \frac{E_r}{r} + \frac{E_{r_O}}{r_O} = -\frac{91p\cos\theta}{3456\pi\varepsilon_0 R^4}
\tag{17}
$$

$$
F_x = -\frac{p^2}{\pi\varepsilon_0 R^4}\left(\frac{1}{27} + \frac{1}{64}\cos^2\theta\right)
\tag{18}
$$

$$
F_y = -\frac{37p^2\sin\theta\cos\theta}{3456\pi\varepsilon_0 R^4}
\tag{19}
$$

3. 偶极子在电场中受力矩为 $\tau = p\times E$

另外由对称性容易得出 $\theta = 0, \pi/2, \pi, 3\pi/2$ 四个位置为平衡位置。

$$
\tau = p_xE_y - p_yE_x = \frac{p\sin\theta\cos\theta}{16\pi\varepsilon_0}\left(\frac{1}{r^3} + \frac{2}{r^3} - \frac{1}{Rr^2} + \frac{1}{Rr_O^2}\right) = \frac{25p\sin 2\theta}{1152\pi\varepsilon_0 R^3}
\tag{20}
$$

$$
\frac{\mathrm{d}\tau}{\mathrm{d}\theta} = \frac{25p^2\cos 2\theta}{576\pi\varepsilon_0 R^3}
\tag{21}
$$

由稳定平衡条件 $\mathrm{d}\tau/\mathrm{d}\theta < 0$ 得 $\theta = \pi/2, 3\pi/2$

$$
T = \left.2\pi\sqrt{\frac{I}{\mathrm{d}\tau/\mathrm{d}\theta}}\right|_{\pi/2} = \frac{48\pi}{5p}\sqrt{\pi\varepsilon_0 R^3 I}
\tag{22}
$$

